[center][size=6][b]Skhroma[/b][/size]
[size=3]Razer Chroma lighting that reacts to Skyrim[/size][/center]

Skhroma is an SKSE plugin that drives every Razer Chroma device from the game: your keyboard, mouse, mousepad, keypad, headset and Chroma Link lights react to your attributes, combat, weather, time of day, transformations, menus and survival needs.

No .esp, no scripts, no plugin slot. Safe to install or remove mid-playthrough.

[size=5][b]What reacts[/b][/size]

[b]Keyboard[/b]
[list]
[*]F1-F4 Magicka, F5-F8 Health, F9-F12 Stamina
[*]WASD glow in combat and fade when stamina is low
[*]Z: shout cooldown (dim while recovering, gold when ready)
[*]Numpad: SunHelm hunger, thirst, fatigue and cold meters
[*]ESC: alarm
[/list]
[b]Mouse[/b]: left strip Health, right strip Stamina.
[b]Mousepad[/b]: the ring mirrors the HUD (Magicka / Health / Stamina).
[b]Keypad[/b]: the 4 SunHelm meters plus a Health column.
[b]Headset / Chroma Link[/b]: ambient color and all global effects.

[b]Global effects on every device[/b]
[list]
[*]Time-of-day and weather ambient: torchlight indoors, rain drops, snow flakes, lightning in storms
[*]Combat embers, sneak, swimming
[*]Werewolf, Vampire Lord and vampire tints
[*]Low-health heartbeat, hit and block flashes
[*]Level-up wave, dragon soul absorption, bleedout and death
[*]SunHelm frost creeping in from the edges as you freeze
[*]Menu dimming, with special looks for the map, lockpicking and sleep/wait
[/list]

[size=5][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE64[/url]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library for SKSE Plugins[/url]
[*]Razer Synapse with Chroma enabled (or another RzChromaSDK64.dll provider, such as open-chroma)
[/list]
[b]Optional[/b]
[list]
[*]SunHelm Survival: enables the hunger / thirst / fatigue / cold meters and the frost effect. Without it these layers simply stay off.
[/list]

[b]Compatibility:[/b] Skyrim SE 1.5.97 and AE 1.6.x (version independent through Address Library). Not for VR. Tested on Nolvus Awakening 6.

[size=5][b]Installation[/b][/size]
Install with Mod Organizer 2 or Vortex. Manual: extract into your Data folder.
The archive contains only:
[code]SKSE/Plugins/Skhroma.dll
SKSE/Plugins/Skhroma.ini
SKSE/Plugins/Skhroma.pdb[/code]
The .pdb is optional; it lets crash loggers name Skhroma functions if something goes wrong.

[size=5][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
Everything can be toggled and tuned in [b]SKSE/Plugins/Skhroma.ini[/b]: each device, each effect, brightness, frame rate, "low" thresholds and the Health / Magicka / Stamina / Frost / Combat colors.

[size=5][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Log file: Documents/My Games/Skyrim Special Edition/SKSE/Skhroma.log
[*]No lights? Check that Razer Synapse is running with Chroma Connect / app access enabled, and look for "Chroma SDK initialized" in the log.
[*]Other apps fighting over the lights? Disable their Chroma integration while playing.
[/list]

